{"message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec 31, 2005. The change from 2005 to 2006 is the later-year reserve minus the prior-year reserve: 10 - 4 = 6 million USD.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"v2006 - v2005","variables":{"v2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"v2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"v2006":"source:q11n3","v2005":"source:q11n4"}}}